Kubernetes Guestbook Application Deployment

1. Project Overview

This task involved deploying the Kubernetes Guestbook application on a K3s Kubernetes cluster.

The application consists of three main components:

Redis Master: Provides the primary Redis service.

Redis Slaves: Two replicas provide Redis follower services.

Frontend: Three PHP frontend replicas communicate with Redis through Kubernetes services.

The resources were deployed in the default namespace.

